// The class tree and its progression tables (ADR-0005). Loaded by
// trpg_content::class.
//
// Source of truth: docs/design/progression.md (tickets 0005, 0016, 0017),
// with weapon kinds from weapons-and-items.md and spells / affinities from
// magic.md. Every number is TUNABLE (FE-sized placeholders until ticket 0013).
// Class names are placeholders too.
//
// Stat rows are in stat order:  (HP, Str, Mag, Dex, Spd, Def, Res)
// `mov` is the class's Mov (movement points); it never grows.
// `weapons` entries are (kind, start rank, max rank).
// `spells` entries are (class level, spell id).
// Skill ids name the skills in progression.md's skill tables; their effects
// are ticket 0311. Tier-3 skills (except the Flier's) aren't designed yet
// (ticket 1001), so those classes have none.
//
// The flying line's tiers 4-5 (Sky Lancer, Sky Warden, Storm Lancer,
// Sky Tyrant) have no numbers yet, so they are left out and Flier's
// `promotes_to` stays empty.
(
    // Highest character level (placeholder; may become huge, ticket 0013).
    level_cap: 99,
    // Highest class level; reaching it masters the class.
    class_level_cap: 10,
